  "Part of the Desk-E family. Read, fill, sign, draw, comment, organise pages, redact and save.": ["Teil der Desk-E-Familie. Lesen, ausfüllen, unterschreiben, zeichnen, kommentieren, Seiten ordnen, schwärzen und speichern.", "Parte de la familia Desk-E. Leer, rellenar, firmar, dibujar, comentar, ordenar páginas, tachar y guardar.", "Fait partie de la famille Desk-E. Lire, remplir, signer, dessiner, commenter, organiser les pages, caviarder et enregistrer.", "Parte da família Desk-E. Ler, preencher, assinar, desenhar, comentar, organizar páginas, tarjar e salvar.", "Parte della famiglia Desk-E. Leggi, compila, firma, disegna, commenta, organizza pagine, oscura e salva."],
